WEBVTT

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:11.646
I share my unstoppable curiosity with you.

00:00:13.765 --> 00:00:17.445
I'm still able to run through the fog...

00:00:17.445 --> 00:00:21.221
...because I know that you're here for me.

00:00:21.230 --> 00:00:28.866
I guess the shape of happiness is different for everyone...

00:00:28.869 --> 00:00:33.202
...however, I know it's boring when I'm alone...

00:00:33.584 --> 00:00:35.050
But, with you...

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:37.168
...it's like a mystery!

00:00:39.016 --> 00:00:42.720
It's an enchanting future, where...

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:47.440
...in order for me to be strong, it's always you...

00:00:47.442 --> 00:00:51.862
...that I can continue to depend on, right?

00:00:51.862 --> 00:00:53.426
Just to survive!

00:00:53.603 --> 00:00:55.372
Stumped Q? Don't lose your way!

00:00:55.369 --> 00:00:57.232
Take this moment...

00:00:57.232 --> 00:01:00.860
...to fix your gaze and charge on ahead!

00:01:00.865 --> 00:01:03.072
Eternally, we'll always be together...

00:01:03.075 --> 00:01:04.901
...searching and pursuing...

00:01:04.908 --> 00:01:08.650
...the meaning of it all.

00:01:08.643 --> 00:01:10.710
Truth is nothing but a labyrinth...

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:12.436
...that we try to continue through...

00:01:12.447 --> 00:01:16.127
...especially when we are hurt.

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:18.331
I'll take you, so come this way.

00:01:18.331 --> 00:01:20.111
I'm certain that, on that day...

00:01:20.116 --> 00:01:24.086
...I'll see your smile, face to face!

00:01:31.535 --> 00:01:37.165
We from Q Class figured out the trick that was used to disguise the murders as mysterious disappearances.

00:01:37.541 --> 00:01:40.752
We suspected the Ekishin high priest who
predicted the mysterious disappearances...

00:01:40.794 --> 00:01:42.170
...and continued to watch him.

00:01:43.088 --> 00:01:47.884
However, a murder occurred that was impossible
for the high priest to commit.

00:01:48.969 --> 00:01:53.056
These two villages were used by the old Japanese
military to develop biological weapons. ,.

00:01:53.849 --> 00:01:56.935
And then, along with the mysterious drawing
that the murdered people held...

00:01:57.310 --> 00:01:59.521
...and after watching the sunrise for a change...

00:02:00.105 --> 00:02:04.985
...Kyuu finally figured out the high priest's trick
as well as this village's biggest secret.

00:02:06.319 --> 00:02:06.945
Stop!

00:02:08.738 --> 00:02:09.739
If the wall breaks...

00:02:11.491 --> 00:02:12.284
...this world is going to...

00:02:14.119 --> 00:02:15.245
...is going to be destroyed!

00:02:19.875 --> 00:02:21.376
What have you done?

00:02:22.252 --> 00:02:25.589
The sacred wall that nobody but
the high priest may pass...

00:02:26.089 --> 00:02:30.260
Please see for yourself what's behind this wall.

00:02:30.719 --> 00:02:31.845
Behind the wall?

00:02:47.152 --> 00:02:48.153
Hyoutan village.

00:02:48.445 --> 00:02:49.154
It's...

00:02:50.614 --> 00:02:51.406
That's right.

00:02:51.865 --> 00:02:53.950
Look, that's the main house of the Ryouzanpaku.

00:02:54.576 --> 00:02:56.202
From here it's just a stone's throw away.

00:02:56.870 --> 00:02:58.288
The door that the high priest
goes in and out of...

00:02:58.914 --> 00:03:01.249
...is actually connected to the second
floor of the house by the dam.

00:03:02.626 --> 00:03:03.752
The reason it looked like a dam...

00:03:04.252 --> 00:03:06.588
...is because the spring water
is lead along this wall.

00:03:07.756 --> 00:03:10.926
Now you all know this village's big lie.

00:03:12.636 --> 00:03:15.180
This village that we thought of as
Kamikakushi village is actually...

00:03:16.097 --> 00:03:20.852
....created by dividing the original gourd-shaped
village with this wall.

00:03:21.144 --> 00:03:22.437
It's a fake town!

00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:29.819
Instead of taking the 30 minute
trip through the tunnel...

00:03:30.111 --> 00:03:35.367
...you can go back and forth between these
two villages in about 1 to 2 minutes.

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:38.495
The note the college student left...

00:03:38.745 --> 00:03:41.706
...was neither the number eight
nor the sign for infinity.

00:03:42.791 --> 00:03:44.376
It was actually a gourd.

00:03:45.502 --> 00:03:46.628
Once I noticed that...

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:50.840
...I immediately checked the position of the sun
with Ryu and Mega in Kamikakushi village.

00:03:51.925 --> 00:03:54.928
Kyuu, what about on your side? Where's
the sun in relation to the tunnel?

00:03:56.096 --> 00:03:56.888
It's the same.

00:03:59.391 --> 00:04:00.266
It's to the right.

00:04:02.102 --> 00:04:04.729
If the two villages are next to each
other and connected by a tunnel...

00:04:05.605 --> 00:04:09.609
...then the sun should be on opposite sides for
two people facing the tunnel on either side.

00:04:10.235 --> 00:04:14.489
But in reality the tunnel was on
our right for both Ryu and me.

00:04:15.699 --> 00:04:18.159
Because of the long spiral staircase...

00:04:18.827 --> 00:04:23.415
...we lost our sense of direction and didn't realize
that we were actually going back the way we came.

00:04:27.877 --> 00:04:32.924
By going back and forth between the two
villages that are only divided by this wall...

00:04:33.758 --> 00:04:38.096
...you could act as both the Ekishin high
priest as well as hostess Fuuma Mio.

00:04:38.763 --> 00:04:44.519
This mechanism was the trick you used to create
your alibi for murdering Iwashimizu-san.

00:04:45.770 --> 00:04:48.356
While you were talking to me
on the cordless phone...

00:04:48.732 --> 00:04:50.608
...you went through the wall of the holy shrine...

00:04:50.734 --> 00:04:53.945
...and proceeded to the Ryouzanpaku
which was right by the dam.

00:04:54.154 --> 00:04:55.238
Oowada-san?

00:04:55.613 --> 00:04:58.283
He isn't even from the village, how did
he have an idea where it might be?

00:04:58.533 --> 00:05:01.077
He used to be an Ekishin believer.

00:05:02.037 --> 00:05:04.497
His appearance changed so I didn't
realize it for a long time...

00:05:05.373 --> 00:05:08.043
...but until three years ago he used
to live in the neighboring village.

00:05:08.918 --> 00:05:13.298
In reality, the distance between the main house
and the branch house is 70 to 80 meters at most.

00:05:13.840 --> 00:05:15.759
So even cordless phones have
no problem with reception.

00:05:17.093 --> 00:05:19.596
Then you went in through the
unwatched backdoor...

00:05:20.263 --> 00:05:23.308
...and went straight to the drugged
Iwashimizu-san's room.

00:05:26.144 --> 00:05:29.105
So did you know about the assistant,
Kagami-san, as well?

00:05:29.606 --> 00:05:30.315
Yes...

00:05:33.735 --> 00:05:36.029
And in the short pause in our conversation...

00:05:37.405 --> 00:05:38.823
...you murdered Iwashimizu-san.

00:05:41.785 --> 00:05:44.454
At that time, if you hadn't accidentally
referred to Kamikakushi village...

00:05:44.621 --> 00:05:49.084
...as the neighboring village in
relation to your position...

00:05:50.085 --> 00:05:51.461
...I wouldn't have figured it out.

00:05:52.462 --> 00:05:53.755
This is unbelievable!

00:05:53.838 --> 00:05:55.924
Someone with such a cute face
is like the devil inside.

00:05:56.216 --> 00:05:59.427
Wait, so what happened to the
actual Kamikakushi village?

00:05:59.886 --> 00:06:02.514
I'm sure that it was there in the
references that I checked.

00:06:03.223 --> 00:06:05.475
Of course, there was a Kamikakushi village.

00:06:06.434 --> 00:06:07.602
But it disappeared.

00:06:08.436 --> 00:06:10.188
No, to be precise...

00:06:10.688 --> 00:06:11.856
It was erased.

00:06:14.734 --> 00:06:18.488
Erased by the hands of the people
that lived here in Hyoutan village.

00:06:19.531 --> 00:06:20.949
Hyoutan village and Kamikakushi village...

00:06:21.491 --> 00:06:22.617
...as Kazuma mentioned earlier...

00:06:22.659 --> 00:06:26.287
...were used by the military to research
smallpox-based biological weapons.

00:06:27.163 --> 00:06:32.836
Smallpox is a horrible virus with a death rate of
over 30% and it can be spread through the air.

00:06:33.878 --> 00:06:37.632
And apparently the smallpox
they cultivated here...

00:06:38.216 --> 00:06:41.511
...was an even stronger strain.

00:06:42.846 --> 00:06:47.767
I suppose they built these two villages in the
mountains that are only accessible by tunnel...

00:06:48.476 --> 00:06:52.939
...to be able to completely seal them
off in a worst case scenario.

00:06:53.857 --> 00:06:58.653
And that worst case scenario became
a reality in Kamikakushi village.

00:07:03.533 --> 00:07:05.994
The vicious strain of smallpox that they
were cultivating as a weapon there...

00:07:06.286 --> 00:07:09.914
...leaked and the people were infected.

00:07:12.584 --> 00:07:16.754
The people in Hyoutan village feared
that the infection would spread...

00:07:17.088 --> 00:07:19.132
...and sealed off the only tunnel.

00:07:20.592 --> 00:07:24.929
Probably, fearing that the remaining people were
infected, even if they didn't show the symptoms...

00:07:25.597 --> 00:07:26.764
...they left them all there.

00:07:29.350 --> 00:07:34.772
But soon thereafter the war ended, and when the
Occupation Forces were coming to Hyoutan village...

00:07:35.815 --> 00:07:38.735
...the villagers mercilessly abandoned
the whole of Kamikakushi village...

00:07:39.444 --> 00:07:41.196
...out of fear of their crime.

00:07:42.655 --> 00:07:47.619
And the answer they came up with in their
desperation was to create another village.

00:07:48.953 --> 00:07:52.123
Thus Hyoutan village was divided by this wall...

00:07:52.415 --> 00:07:53.875
...one side disguised as a dam...

00:07:54.250 --> 00:07:57.587
...the other camouflaged as the wall of
the holy shrine of the Ekishin religion.

00:07:58.421 --> 00:08:01.132
They went as far as to create
a tunnel with a U-turn in it...

00:08:01.925 --> 00:08:05.261
...in order to make two villages out
of the single Hyoutan village.

00:08:06.721 --> 00:08:09.849
Of course, at the start, the people
from Hyoutan village...

00:08:10.099 --> 00:08:11.768
...pretended to be the villagers
of Kamikakushi village.

00:08:12.810 --> 00:08:17.398
The original reason for the rule that all
inhabitants of Kamikakushi village wear masks...

00:08:17.815 --> 00:08:22.362
...was to hide the double role that the people
of Hyoutan village were playing.

00:08:23.154 --> 00:08:26.199
And so, in order to protect the village's secret...

00:08:26.407 --> 00:08:31.120
...Mio-san's grandfather took up the important
duty of high priest and dam manager.

00:08:31.454 --> 00:08:34.624
He erased those that figured out
the secret one after the other...

00:08:34.791 --> 00:08:36.501
...disguising the murders as
mysterious disappearances.

00:08:38.002 --> 00:08:38.711
Mio-san...

00:08:39.087 --> 00:08:42.382
You inherited the role of guardian of
the secret from your grandfather.

00:08:44.259 --> 00:08:46.636
Judging from the time line...

00:08:47.553 --> 00:08:49.347
...you're the murderer of the college student.

00:08:50.473 --> 00:08:56.479
Then you murdered Azegami-san who had figured
out the secret from the college student's note.

00:08:57.772 --> 00:09:02.527
Now then, I have to wake up early
tomorrow and confirm "that".

00:09:05.571 --> 00:09:07.573
And right in front of you in
your high priest costume...

00:09:08.866 --> 00:09:13.913
I think I kind of know the meaning of the
picture Azegami-Chan was holding.

00:09:14.706 --> 00:09:18.668
...he said that he had figured out the note's
meaning, so Anzai-san had to go too.

00:09:20.253 --> 00:09:21.421
This piece of shit!

00:09:22.046 --> 00:09:24.090
Now it's not about the treasure!

00:09:24.757 --> 00:09:29.178
I swear on my career as a TV man that I'm going
to find out the truth behind your Ekishin religion!

00:09:29.971 --> 00:09:32.515
Iwashimizu-san who said that he'd
reveal the village's secret...

00:09:34.350 --> 00:09:35.184
You killed him too.

00:09:38.396 --> 00:09:42.734
If you think about it, we could have
been targeted any time too.

00:09:43.067 --> 00:09:49.407
I guess it was the right thing to do when
Kyuu said we're playing detectives.

00:09:50.950 --> 00:09:54.996
If we had said that we're on a DDS murder
investigation we could have been...

00:09:56.331 --> 00:09:58.791
Mio-san, let's end this.

00:10:00.335 --> 00:10:03.004
I'm asking you to please admit your sins.

00:10:04.130 --> 00:10:04.547
Mio-san?

00:10:05.381 --> 00:10:06.299
Don't come any closer.

00:10:07.342 --> 00:10:10.386
, Do you know what's in this vial?

00:10:11.554 --> 00:10:15.433
It's the devil's virus that annihilated
the original Kamikakushi village.

00:10:18.102 --> 00:10:20.271
If you're infected, then the probability
of your death is 100%.

00:10:21.105 --> 00:10:22.523
This is the mutated strain of smallpox.

00:10:24.609 --> 00:10:27.695
I'm done for, it's come this far, so it's me...

00:10:28.279 --> 00:10:28.738
Mio-san...

00:10:29.238 --> 00:10:30.073
Yes, that's right.

00:10:30.448 --> 00:10:31.699
The final one to be spirited away...

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:33.117
...will be me.

00:10:34.911 --> 00:10:35.870
Don't be stupid!

00:10:36.329 --> 00:10:37.080
If you do that...

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:37.497
That's right.

00:10:37.872 --> 00:10:42.293
Even now on the other side of this sealed
off tunnel the devil's virus is still alive.

00:10:43.002 --> 00:10:48.049
If those that mistake it for a treasure and
break the seal to go to that village...

00:10:48.216 --> 00:10:51.260
...the virus would spread in an
instant, and this country...

00:10:51.803 --> 00:10:53.930
...no, this world, will be destroyed.

00:10:54.555 --> 00:10:55.640
If that happens...

00:10:55.765 --> 00:10:58.476
Why have I been so desperately
protecting the secret?

00:10:58.684 --> 00:11:00.561
So this is the only thing I can do.

00:11:01.020 --> 00:11:03.272
When the village's secret is revealed...

00:11:03.564 --> 00:11:05.483
...Like I promised my grandfather
that I would do...

00:11:05.650 --> 00:11:07.735
...I have to show everyone an example...

00:11:08.444 --> 00:11:11.739
...of the horrifying effect of this
devil's virus on my own body!

00:11:13.574 --> 00:11:14.117
Mio-san!

00:11:15.993 --> 00:11:16.577
Wait!

00:11:17.203 --> 00:11:17.703
Damn it.

00:11:18.037 --> 00:11:19.038
She locked it from inside.

00:11:19.038 --> 00:11:19.497
Move.

00:11:24.794 --> 00:11:25.294
Let's go, Kyuu.

00:11:26.170 --> 00:11:26.921
I'll go too.

00:11:27.213 --> 00:11:27.922
Me too!

00:11:29.298 --> 00:11:30.383
R-Ryu-kun...

00:11:30.758 --> 00:11:34.220
If the content of that vial is actually
a dangerous pathogen...

00:11:34.929 --> 00:11:36.097
...we might die if we go in there.

00:11:36.889 --> 00:11:39.559
I'm sure Dan-Sensei doesn't want that.

00:11:40.893 --> 00:11:41.769
We might die...

00:11:42.687 --> 00:11:43.438
Detective Ootawara...

00:11:44.439 --> 00:11:47.900
Please request a squad wearing
hazard suits immediately.

00:11:48.151 --> 00:11:50.153
Alright, I'll do that right away.

00:11:50.445 --> 00:11:51.779
But what about Kyuu and Kinta?

00:11:53.448 --> 00:11:54.073
Kyuu...

00:11:58.411 --> 00:12:01.289
Crap, it's too dark to see anything.

00:12:03.541 --> 00:12:04.208
It's a dead end.

00:12:04.542 --> 00:12:05.168
That can't be...

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:07.295
Then where did Mio-san go?

00:12:08.087 --> 00:12:08.588
Mio-san...

00:12:13.843 --> 00:12:15.178
Kinta, it's a hidden door!

00:12:16.304 --> 00:12:19.474
I guess it's set up so that even in the case
that someone got in the holy shrine...

00:12:19.849 --> 00:12:21.809
...they couldn't go any further.

00:12:22.059 --> 00:12:23.603
It's like a freaking ninja house.

00:12:23.936 --> 00:12:24.520
Alright!

00:12:27.023 --> 00:12:27.315
Kyuu!

00:12:44.231 --> 00:12:44.857
Mio-san...

00:12:50.696 --> 00:12:52.281
Good, you're still alive.

00:12:52.990 --> 00:12:53.741
Don't come any closer!

00:12:54.241 --> 00:12:57.203
I'll hit you with this vial if you take another step!

00:12:57.536 --> 00:12:58.287
Why?

00:12:59.121 --> 00:13:00.206
I don't get it at all.

00:13:01.123 --> 00:13:03.209
Why do you have to go this far?

00:13:03.375 --> 00:13:04.543
Of course you don't get it!

00:13:05.377 --> 00:13:06.796
You went to school like a normal kid...

00:13:06.921 --> 00:13:07.922
...played with your friends...

00:13:08.631 --> 00:13:11.634
...and went home to tell your
parents about your day.

00:13:12.259 --> 00:13:15.596
There's no way that someone who's had a normal
life like you can understand my feelings!

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:18.974
Everyday I was shown this virus.

00:13:19.475 --> 00:13:21.852
Everyday I was told stories of hell on earth.

00:13:22.478 --> 00:13:25.898
I grew up being told that it was
my duty to protect this country.

00:13:26.398 --> 00:13:28.192
There's no way that you could
understand my feelings!

00:13:29.401 --> 00:13:29.944
Mio-san...

00:13:30.486 --> 00:13:33.030
Ever since I can remember, my
parents were already gone.

00:13:33.072 --> 00:13:34.115
Ever since I can remember, my
parents were already gone.

00:13:34.406 --> 00:13:36.575
I was taken in by the old man who
lived in the house by the dam.

00:13:37.535 --> 00:13:39.787
The two of us always lived alone.

00:13:40.955 --> 00:13:44.041
My grandpa was always kind, but...

00:13:44.750 --> 00:13:46.377
...as soon as anyone approached the dam...

00:13:46.710 --> 00:13:48.420
...he became like someone filled with anger.

00:13:49.463 --> 00:13:52.967
I was a little afraid of my grandpa
when he got like that.

00:13:53.801 --> 00:13:56.387
My kind grandpa, my grandpa
that was like a demon...

00:13:56.971 --> 00:13:59.723
...which one was my real grandpa?

00:14:01.100 --> 00:14:02.143
One day...

00:14:07.773 --> 00:14:10.025
I secretly followed my grandpa.

00:14:11.110 --> 00:14:15.364
I felt like I could see my grandpa's real
face that I always wondered about.

00:14:25.082 --> 00:14:25.541
Who's there?

00:14:26.385 --> 00:14:26.877
M-Mio...

00:14:27.918 --> 00:14:31.964
That night my grandpa told me a horrible story.

00:14:34.466 --> 00:14:39.138
The tragedy that happened about 50 years
ago, in the real Kamikakushi village.

00:14:39.471 --> 00:14:40.931
Just like what Ryu said.

00:14:41.807 --> 00:14:42.558
Yeah.

00:14:43.309 --> 00:14:46.187
My grandpa was apparently involved
in the sealing of the tunnel...

00:14:46.562 --> 00:14:48.189
was a young officer in Hyoutan village.

00:14:49.231 --> 00:14:55.654
And everybody that participated in the sealing
process swore to protect this secret forever.

00:14:56.363 --> 00:14:57.698
Ever since that day...

00:14:57.948 --> 00:15:02.661
...I stopped going to elementary school and
learned how to protect this village's secret.

00:15:03.078 --> 00:15:06.582
In order to remain unidentified,
I kept a low profile.

00:15:07.458 --> 00:15:11.170
Every day my grandpa told me
about the horrible accident...

00:15:11.420 --> 00:15:14.548
...took out this vial from the
refrigerator and said...

00:15:15.466 --> 00:15:21.347
"After I die, you have to become the Ekishin
high priest and protect this village."

00:15:21.972 --> 00:15:22.473
0
Mn...

00:15:23.140 --> 00:15:25.351
...if the secret is in danger of being revealed...

00:15:25.768 --> 00:15:28.312
...you have to spirit them away.

00:15:28.646 --> 00:15:30.773
That's what it takes to protect the world.

00:15:31.190 --> 00:15:34.401
And if by chance you are unable
to protect the secret...

00:15:34.693 --> 00:15:40.324
...end your life by showing them the horrifying
effects of the virus inside this vial.

00:15:40.616 --> 00:15:41.909
Yes, grandpa.

00:15:42.910 --> 00:15:44.995
The first spiriting away I performed...

00:15:45.871 --> 00:15:47.039
...was that of that college student.

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:50.334
I was scared but I did my best.

00:15:50.709 --> 00:15:53.420
I kept thinking how I could make
it look like he was spirited away.

00:15:54.421 --> 00:15:57.299
So then you came up with the trick with
the rubber raft and the footsteps.

00:15:58.676 --> 00:15:59.385
That's right.

00:16:00.052 --> 00:16:03.055
When the villagers saw it and believed that
it was a mysterious disappearance...

00:16:04.014 --> 00:16:05.766
...I was so relieved.

00:16:07.434 --> 00:16:08.435
Now, it's alright.

00:16:09.144 --> 00:16:12.064
Grandpa, I protected our secret.

00:16:12.856 --> 00:16:16.860
To prevent the horrible smallpox virus from
leaking outside and killing lots of people...

00:16:16.986 --> 00:16:18.445
...the mysterious disappearances are necessary.

00:16:19.780 --> 00:16:23.534
Little sacrifices are necessary in order
to prevent large sacrifices.

00:16:24.243 --> 00:16:28.831
While I was repeating the words that
my grandpa had taught me...

00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:34.128
...I felt like something pure was
flowing through my body.

00:16:35.879 --> 00:16:38.215
Yes, I am certain it was Ekigami-sama!

00:16:38.757 --> 00:16:39.258
I'm the priestess who performs the
rituals to soothe Ekigami's anger.

00:16:39.300 --> 00:16:43.721
I'm the priestess who performs the
rituals to soothe Ekigami's anger.

00:16:44.638 --> 00:16:47.891
If I sacrifice myself as a priestess and
douse myself with this virus...

00:16:48.017 --> 00:16:51.770
...I can demonstrate its horrifying effects and
the village will remain sealed off forever.

00:16:52.104 --> 00:16:54.023
For ever and ever, for all eternity!

00:16:54.106 --> 00:16:54.857
That's a lie!

00:16:56.442 --> 00:17:00.070
It's a downright lie that you've been
doing it to protect the world.

00:17:01.739 --> 00:17:04.575
Neither the military who chose
to abandon an entire village...

00:17:05.200 --> 00:17:09.330
...nor your grandfather who killed people
for decades in order to hide that village...

00:17:10.372 --> 00:17:12.291
...did it to protect the world.

00:17:13.083 --> 00:17:15.169
They really just wanted to protect themselves!

00:17:17.755 --> 00:17:21.300
Every time I see news about
war on TV I wonder...

00:17:22.509 --> 00:17:24.762
...who would ever want something
as cruel as that.

00:17:25.971 --> 00:17:28.807
I'm certain it's just a few adults who
think only about themselves...

00:17:29.683 --> 00:17:32.603
...and drag everyone in with the lie
that it's for the sake of the world.

00:17:33.604 --> 00:17:35.105
Your grandpa and the others were just like that!

00:17:35.773 --> 00:17:39.068
Just so they wouldn't become infected,
they abandoned their comrades.

00:17:39.360 --> 00:17:43.280
And to keep that hidden, he kept on killing
people and even dragged you into it!

00:17:45.115 --> 00:17:45.616
That's selfish!

00:17:46.033 --> 00:17:46.950
That's too selfish!

00:17:48.077 --> 00:17:50.621
They lied to keep their cowardice hidden.

00:17:52.039 --> 00:17:53.749
And then, even though you
had nothing to do with it...

00:17:54.500 --> 00:17:55.709
This is so horrible.

00:17:56.919 --> 00:17:58.128
Damn it!

00:18:01.090 --> 00:18:01.799
Please stop.

00:18:02.716 --> 00:18:03.384
Mio-san...

00:18:04.134 --> 00:18:06.512
Don't start saying stuff like that now.

00:18:07.471 --> 00:18:08.472
I don't want to hear it.

00:18:10.140 --> 00:18:11.475
I killed them.

00:18:12.184 --> 00:18:13.560
I've got nowhere left to go.

00:18:14.228 --> 00:18:16.814
I can't go home anymore!

00:18:17.231 --> 00:18:17.981
Don't!

00:18:27.950 --> 00:18:29.576
That was a secret Touyama-style move.

00:18:29.785 --> 00:18:33.497
call it "let's sleep for a little while, Version 1."

00:18:34.248 --> 00:18:35.791
That was a close one, wasn't it, Kyuu?

00:18:37.376 --> 00:18:39.628
What about the vial? The vial with the virus...

00:18:41.380 --> 00:18:43.590
As you can see, I got it all under control.

00:18:46.635 --> 00:18:49.888
Man pull yourself together, that was nothing.

00:18:50.639 --> 00:18:54.476
I'm so glad that she didn't have to die.

00:18:55.310 --> 00:18:57.771
I wouldn't know what to do if she had died.

00:18:59.231 --> 00:18:59.773
Kyuu...

00:19:00.441 --> 00:19:05.654
With this, the dark phantom of the past that had
controlled both Hyoutan and Kamikakushi village...

00:19:05.946 --> 00:19:07.865
...had finally disappeared.

00:19:14.538 --> 00:19:15.831
Kyuu, Kinta!

00:19:17.374 --> 00:19:22.546
The mysterious disappearance of the college
student and series of murders which followed...

00:19:22.754 --> 00:19:24.506
...were quietly concluded.

00:19:25.048 --> 00:19:25.716
Kyuu!

00:19:26.550 --> 00:19:27.843
What's wrong, Megu?

00:19:28.010 --> 00:19:31.638
I was... I was really worried!

00:19:38.353 --> 00:19:40.856
I see, I sea, fish-paste cake-roll.

00:19:40.856 --> 00:19:44.276
There is a reason Dan-Sensei
chose these five kids.

00:19:46.028 --> 00:19:49.823
Nanami Koutarou, completing
my observation of Q Class.

00:19:50.949 --> 00:19:51.617
See ya.

00:19:56.121 --> 00:20:00.501
After that, Mio-san slept peacefully for two days.

00:20:04.546 --> 00:20:05.923
Where are we going?

00:20:06.256 --> 00:20:08.800
There's something I want to show you.

00:20:09.635 --> 00:20:10.719
Something you want to show me?

00:20:11.512 --> 00:20:12.513
See, over there.

00:20:13.305 --> 00:20:16.767
The tunnel was sealed off right where
this spiral staircase ends.

00:20:19.186 --> 00:20:23.273
Beyond this tunnel lies the real Kamikakushi
village that had been sealed off.

00:20:25.067 --> 00:20:25.526
Let's go.

00:20:26.318 --> 00:20:27.986
But the devil's virus!

00:20:28.695 --> 00:20:29.863
It's alright, Mio-san.

00:20:32.991 --> 00:20:34.576
It's...

00:20:40.958 --> 00:20:42.584
Isn't it beautiful?

00:20:43.085 --> 00:20:45.754
When we first saw it, we were
quite surprised too.

00:20:46.463 --> 00:20:50.968
This wasn't hell like your grandfather
described it to be.

00:20:52.427 --> 00:20:55.389
This can't be true... This is...

00:20:57.266 --> 00:21:00.686
Someone must have been plowing
the field until just a few years ago.

00:21:01.270 --> 00:21:02.688
What does this all mean?

00:21:03.939 --> 00:21:06.108
There were survivors in this village.

00:21:06.900 --> 00:21:11.071
They, never realized that the war was
over and lived here for decades.

00:21:13.240 --> 00:21:16.451
The 100% death rate upon infection was a lie.

00:21:16.910 --> 00:21:21.081
And to top it off, there was no dangerous
virus in that vial that you had.

00:21:21.582 --> 00:21:22.958
There was no virus?

00:21:23.333 --> 00:21:25.794
Then all those things my grandpa told me were...

00:21:27.004 --> 00:21:27.546
No.

00:21:28.213 --> 00:21:29.756
Judging from the looks of this village...

00:21:29.881 --> 00:21:32.801
...it seems it's true that the virus
escaped and many people died.

00:21:34.011 --> 00:21:36.305
Despite that, a few people survived.

00:21:40.225 --> 00:21:41.184
Mio-san, here.

00:21:42.269 --> 00:21:44.104
This is a diary of someone that lived here.

00:21:45.397 --> 00:21:46.315
Why don't you read it?

00:21:51.445 --> 00:21:55.324
First you see entries that talk about
being afraid of the sickness.

00:21:55.907 --> 00:22:00.412
But they write about that less and less and
it even in a small, sealed village like this...

00:22:01.079 --> 00:22:03.498
...they seem to have lived quite peacefully.

00:22:04.166 --> 00:22:06.668
Mio-san, aren't humans amazing?

00:22:07.336 --> 00:22:12.799
I mean they survived even after being locked
in this place with a spreading epidemic.

00:22:13.383 --> 00:22:13.800
That's right.

00:22:14.259 --> 00:22:16.928
So, you can atone for your sins too.

00:22:18.055 --> 00:22:18.639
Mio-san?

00:22:21.558 --> 00:22:26.271
In that moment, Mio-san might
have been released...

00:22:26.480 --> 00:22:31.234
...from the spell of the ugly past of this
village which held her for so long.

00:22:34.237 --> 00:22:37.074
Thanks for all your help, Detective Ootawara.

00:22:37.407 --> 00:22:41.370
Don't mention it, we benefited
a lot from your help.

00:22:42.037 --> 00:22:45.290
Please pass on my words of gratitude
to Dan-Sensei as well.

00:22:46.208 --> 00:22:47.042
Thank you very much.

00:22:47.751 --> 00:22:48.335
Thank you.

00:22:53.048 --> 00:22:53.632
Shall we go then?

00:22:58.011 --> 00:23:00.514
I hope Mio-san recovers.

00:23:01.348 --> 00:23:02.724
She'll be fine.

00:23:03.392 --> 00:23:04.059
She'll definitely be fine.

00:23:04.434 --> 00:23:07.896
Yeah, my 100% accurate instinct says the same.

00:23:08.814 --> 00:23:10.440
Hey, listen guys...

00:23:10.857 --> 00:23:13.860
...the legend of the treasure might
have been true in a sense.

00:23:16.863 --> 00:23:22.703
Don't you think that this paradise overflowing
with flowers is like a magnificent treasure?

00:23:23.453 --> 00:23:26.039
I see, this might actually be a treasure.

00:23:27.541 --> 00:23:29.543
This is a really beautiful flower garden.

00:23:37.342 --> 00:23:40.549
The Sun is setting in a red glow...

00:23:41.141 --> 00:23:43.680
...as it follows me.

00:23:44.018 --> 00:23:46.849
Along this deserted beach...

00:23:46.852 --> 00:23:50.783
...I walk alone once more.

00:23:50.790 --> 00:23:54.165
I can't continue to hold in...

00:23:54.817 --> 00:23:57.149
...the tears that should pour out.

00:23:57.786 --> 00:24:00.253
Why have these memories...

00:24:00.263 --> 00:24:03.793
...become so wonderful?

00:24:04.337 --> 00:24:09.356
Ah... Like an ocean wave, I return to you...

00:24:09.606 --> 00:24:12.129
...because I'm so in love.

00:24:12.860 --> 00:24:15.846
And, now my heart...

00:24:15.851 --> 00:24:17.990
...is heavy with pain.

00:24:18.944 --> 00:24:21.923
Reflections of a bright rainbow...

00:24:22.011 --> 00:24:26.147
...shine on the distant shores of yesturday.

00:24:26.487 --> 00:24:30.118
I'll never forget those days...

00:24:30.125 --> 00:24:35.211
...and I long to see you again.

00:24:37.686 --> 00:24:40.355
Good work on your first live mission.

00:24:40.605 --> 00:24:41.231
Thank you!

00:24:42.107 --> 00:24:47.029
I'm really glad that you exceeded my expectations.

00:24:47.779 --> 00:24:53.785
But that means that you, as detectives, are moving towards even more rigorous cases.

00:24:54.536 --> 00:24:55.954
Yes,we know.

00:24:57.247 --> 00:24:59.291
But if we hesitated because
of something like that...

00:24:59.624 --> 00:25:01.543
...we couldn't become real detectives.

00:25:02.586 --> 00:25:04.421
As long as there are mysteries...

00:25:05.672 --> 00:25:07.341
...we can't give up.

00:25:09.402 --> 00:25:10.376
There's only one answer!
There's only one answer!
